#### 9. General Fixture — `quantityZeroOnUnknownSku` (line 103) + others

`@BeforeEach` initializes `rng`, which is **never used by any test**. Every test pays the setup cost of an unnecessary field.

```java
@BeforeEach
void setUp() {
    catalog = new Catalog();
    rng = new Random();   // ← dead fixture field
}
```

**Refactor:** Remove `rng` entirely from the class and `setUp`:

```java
@BeforeEach
