#### 10. Ignored Test — `disabledTest` (line 110)

`@Disabled("flaky, fix later")` — the reason is vague and has no tracking reference. This test will likely stay disabled forever.

```java
@Disabled("flaky, fix later")
```

**Refactor:** Either fix and re-enable the test now (it is trivially correct), or link to a tracking issue:

```java
@Disabled("Tracked by JIRA-1234 — intermittent ordering issue")
```

In this case the test body is straightforward and not flaky — just remove `@Disabled`.

